Here is the commit message:
fixes error

Here is the root cause:
The `Workflow` object was instantiated using a custom/dynamic `classLoader` (used to load experiment-specific classes at runtime), but the `Serializer` component obtained from `workflow.getSerializer()` was not configured to use this same classloader. By default, the serializer likely relied on the default/system classloader (e.g., the thread's context classloader or the classloader of the serializer class itself) when deserializing objects. Since the experiment's custom classes (such as message types or workflow-specific classes) were only visible to the dynamically created `classLoader`, the serializer failed to resolve these classes during deserialization, resulting in a `ClassNotFoundException` or similar runtime error. The fix explicitly synchronizes the serializer's classloader with the one used to load the workflow, ensuring consistent class resolution across the entire workflow execution context.

Here is the patch:
 	@Override
 	public String startExperiment(String experimentId, boolean worker) throws TException {
 		Experiment experiment = getExperiment(experimentId);
 		ExperimentRegistry.addExperiment(experiment);
 		try {
 
 			if (!isBrokerRunning()) {
 				startBroker();
 			}
 
 			Mode mode = Mode.MASTER;
 			if (!worker)
 				mode = Mode.MASTER_BARE;
 
 			ClassLoader classLoader = new URLClassLoader(
 					new URL[] { new File(servlet.getServletContext()
 							.getRealPath("experiments/" + experimentId + "/" + experiment.getJar())).toURI().toURL() },
 					Thread.currentThread().getContextClassLoader());
 
 			Workflow workflow = (Workflow) classLoader.loadClass(experiment.getClassName())
 					.getConstructor(Mode.class).newInstance(mode);
-
+			workflow.getSerializer().setClassloader(classLoader);
 			workflow.setInstanceId(experimentId);
 			workflow.createBroker(false);
 			File cacheDir = new File(servlet.getServletContext().getRealPath("experiments/" + experimentId + "/cache"));
 			cacheDir.mkdirs();
 			workflow.setCache(new DirectoryCache(cacheDir));
 			workflow.setInputDirectory(new File(servlet.getServletContext()
 					.getRealPath("experiments/" + experimentId + "/" + experiment.getInputDirectory())));
 			workflow.setOutputDirectory(new File(servlet.getServletContext()
 					.getRealPath("experiments/" + experimentId + "/" + experiment.getOutputDirectory())));
 
 			workflow.run();
 			workflow.log(SEVERITY.INFO, "Workflow " + workflow.getName() + " started.");
 
 			// add new workflow to registry
 			ExperimentRegistry.addWorkflow(workflow, experimentId);
 
 			// remove workflow from registry after termination
 			new Thread(new Runnable() {
 				@Override
 				public void run() {
 					workflow.awaitTermination();
 					ExperimentRegistry.removeWorkflow(experimentId);
 				}
 			}).start();
 
 			return workflow.getInstanceId();
 		} catch (Exception e) {
 			e.printStackTrace();


